      "id": "claim_d8851df7594a4cd1801845ac23a5f0ea",
      "statement": "The @brijio/mcp package ships the brijio CLI (bin/brijio.mjs, with browserbridge as a deprecated alias); the bin auto-generates BRIJIO_PAIRING_TOKEN and MCP_HTTP_AUTH_TOKEN when unset, mirrors pairing token to legacy BROWSERBRIDGE_* vars, sets host/port defaults, dynamically imports server modules only in run mode, and starts the WebSocket and MCP HTTP servers together in run mode.",
