      "id": "claim_560df4d101614dc89610309b10ccc076",
      "statement": "requestBrijio is the shared one-shot WebSocket engine: it returns auth_required without opening a socket when pairingToken is blank, opens a WebSocket, sends an auth envelope (role mcp, token) on open, waits for auth_success before sending the targeted request envelope, enforces a timeout, resolves connection_failed on error or unexpected close, and runs every message through parseRouterErrorEnvelope (forwarding real relay error codes) before the per-request parseEnvelope.",
